00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:50.590
He has a motorcycle though.

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:57.550
I would like to see them joke about Felicity’s
van being their official team arrow car.

00:06:57.550 --> 00:06:59.410
She ran over Summer Glau in it.

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:03.730
It would be great if they never fixed the
dent that she left and anytime someone made

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:06.480
fun of felicity, everyone just looked at the
dent and got quiet.

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:15.500
They’ve still got a lot of filming left
to do on Batman vs Superman but more and more

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:17.780
