00:07:17.780 --> 00:07:20.860
There was an image of Jesse Eisenberg with
weird Lex Luthor hair.

00:07:20.860 --> 00:07:25.300
It’s not a guarantee or anything, but this
might be what he looks like in the film.

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:28.390
Jason Momoa has all but confirmed he’s playing
aquaman too.

00:07:28.390 --> 00:07:33.270
I don’t think I did a video about it, but
Zack Snyder called a radio station defending

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:34.730
the idea of Aquaman.

00:07:34.730 --> 00:07:39.300
He wasn’t confirming the character was in
the movie, but later jason momoa wouldn’t

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:43.000
