the movie during interviews.

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:45.400
So do not be surprised if he shows up.

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:48.919
It’s one of the worst kept secrets about
the whole thing.

00:07:48.919 --> 00:07:49.919
I still remember him from his stargate days.

00:07:49.919 --> 00:07:51.669
I haven’t really liked his leading roles.

00:07:51.669 --> 00:07:52.669
Like Conan.

00:07:52.669 --> 00:07:55.580
But I think he can do really well in an ensemble.

